      "title": "Deterministic Finite State Machine",
      "items": [
        "StateGraph is strictly bounded: prevents unbounded tool recursion loops",
        "Checkpointer integration preserves multi-turn session state in RAM or SQLite",
        "Every path monotonically converges to generate_answer and terminal END"
      ]
